{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I use a threading.Lock?"}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "A Lock prevents race conditions on shared state:\n\n```python\nimport threading\n\ncounter = 0\nlock = threading.Lock()\n\ndef increment():\n    global counter\n    for _ in range(100000):\n        with lock:\n            counter += 1\n\nthreads = [threading.Thread(target=increment) for _ in range(2)]\nfor t in threads:\n    t.start()\nfor t in threads:\n    t.join()\nprint(counter)  # 200000\n```"}]}
