{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I make sequential vs concurrent comparison in asyncio?"}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nimport asyncio\nimport time\n\nasync def task():\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n\nasync def sequential():\n    start = time.perf_counter()\n    await task(); await task()\n    print(f\"sequential: {time.perf_counter()-start:.1f}s\")  # ~2s\n\nasync def concurrent():\n    start = time.perf_counter()\n    await asyncio.gather(task(), task())\n    print(f\"concurrent: {time.perf_counter()-start:.1f}s\")  # ~1s\n\nasyncio.run(sequential())\nasyncio.run(concurrent())\n```"}]}
