{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "How do I run multiple async HTTP calls with different methods?"}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nimport aiohttp\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def main():\n    async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:\n        async def get():\n            async with session.get(\"https://httpbin.org/get\") as r:\n                return await r.json()\n        async def post():\n            async with session.post(\"https://httpbin.org/post\", json={\"a\": 1}) as r:\n                return await r.json()\n        g, p = await asyncio.gather(get(), post())\n        return g[\"url\"], p[\"url\"]\n\nprint(asyncio.run(main()))\n```"}]}
